      "id": "PRIN 2A.8.3R",
      "url": "https://handbook.fca.org.uk/handbook/PRIN/2A/8.html",
      "verbatim": true,
      "text": "A firm must prepare a report for its governing body setting out the results of its monitoring under PRIN 2A.9 and any actions required as a result of the monitoring.",
